Package: telegramtracker
Title: Telegram Expense and Habit Tracker
Version: 0.1.0
Description: A Telegram bot written in R that logs expenses and habits to CSV files
    and runs for free on GitHub Actions. This file only lists dependencies so the
    workflows can install and cache them.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    curl,
    ggplot2
